<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:17:01 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>11 月 24 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-24</link><description>由于有关油轮进一步袭击的报道掩盖了解决美伊战争的最新外交努力，油价在交投清淡中小幅走高。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-24'&gt;11 月 24 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 24&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-24</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 23:04:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>高盛取消抵押品赎回权后 Netflix 收购《宋飞正传》工作室土地</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/netflix-buys-seinfeld-la-studio-lot-after-goldman-forecloses</link><description>高盛集团 (Goldman Sachs Group Inc.) 控制了拉德福德工作室中心 (Radford Studio Center)，这是《宋飞正传》(Seinfeld) 的拍摄地，Netflix 公司宣布以 3.8 亿美元的价格收购该地块。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/netflix-buys-seinfeld-la-studio-lot-after-goldman-forecloses'&gt;高盛取消抵押品赎回权后 Netflix 收购《宋飞正传》工作室土地&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Netflix Buys Seinfeld Studio Lot After Goldman Forecloses&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/netflix-buys-seinfeld-la-studio-lot-after-goldman-forecloses</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:15:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着股市下跌，国债上涨，避险需求复苏</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/treasuries-advance-as-cheaper-oil-alleviates-inflation-concerns</link><description>由于美国股市回吐了周一大幅上涨的部分涨幅，美国国债因避险需求而上涨，这表明投资者仍对技术投资继续推动经济增长的潜力感到不安。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/treasuries-advance-as-cheaper-oil-alleviates-inflation-concerns'&gt;随着股市下跌，国债上涨，避险需求复苏&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasuries Advance as Stocks Fall, Reviving Haven Demand&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/treasuries-advance-as-cheaper-oil-alleviates-inflation-concerns</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 04:42:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>摩根大通设定的 2027 年标准普尔 500 指数低于共识目标 8,200 点</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/jpmorgan-sets-below-consensus-s-p-500-target-of-8-200-for-2027</link><description>摩根大通策略师预计，到 2027 年底，美国股市都会上涨，人工智能仍然是盈利增长的驱动力。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/jpmorgan-sets-below-consensus-s-p-500-target-of-8-200-for-2027'&gt;摩根大通设定的 2027 年标准普尔 500 指数低于共识目标 8,200 点&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：JPMorgan Sets Below Consensus S&amp;P 500 Target of 8,200 for 2027&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/jpmorgan-sets-below-consensus-s-p-500-target-of-8-200-for-2027</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:55:49 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>加拿大央行调整核心措施，聚焦2%通胀目标</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/bank-of-canada-fades-core-inflation-switches-gauges</link><description>加拿大央行行长蒂夫·麦克莱姆表示，作为新货币政策框架的一部分，加拿大央行正在改变衡量潜在价格压力的指标。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/bank-of-canada-fades-core-inflation-switches-gauges'&gt;加拿大央行调整核心措施，聚焦2%通胀目标&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bank of Canada Shakes Up Core Measures, Focuses on 2% Inflation Target&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/bank-of-canada-fades-core-inflation-switches-gauges</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:25:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>俄罗斯人在针对 Palantir 的窥探案中不认罪</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/russian-pleads-not-guilty-in-snooping-case-targeting-palantir</link><description>一名俄罗斯国民对美国指控他作为外国特工、就乌克兰战时使用 Palantir Technologies Inc. 软件而秘密获取该公司工人的信息表示不认罪。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/russian-pleads-not-guilty-in-snooping-case-targeting-palantir'&gt;俄罗斯人在针对 Palantir 的窥探案中不认罪&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Russian Pleads Not Guilty in Snooping Case Targeting Palantir&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/russian-pleads-not-guilty-in-snooping-case-targeting-palantir</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:04:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Anthropic 股价第四个交易日跌破 IPO 价格</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/anthropic-breaks-below-83-ipo-price-in-premarket-trading</link><description>Anthropic PBC 股价首次低于 83 美元的首次公开募股价格，抹去了上周涌入该人工智能实验室创纪录首次公开募股的投资者的涨幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/anthropic-breaks-below-83-ipo-price-in-premarket-trading'&gt;Anthropic 股价第四个交易日跌破 IPO 价格&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic Shares Plunge Below IPO Price in Fourth Trading Day&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/anthropic-breaks-below-83-ipo-price-in-premarket-trading</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:19:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>纳斯达克 100 指数因 AI 溃败和关税上调谈话而下跌 2%：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>华尔街对人工智能贸易持久性的怀疑导致科技股下跌，交易员也在分析有关美国新关税的讨论。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;纳斯达克 100 指数因 AI 溃败和关税上调谈话而下跌 2%：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Falls 2% on AI Rout, Tariff Hike Talk: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:06:46 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>